  "An old-town evening": "古城的傍晚",
  "Temple lights and craft stalls invite one more stroll through Luang Prabang.": "寺庙灯火与手工艺摊位，让人忍不住在琅勃拉邦再多走一会儿。",
  "Let the river set the pace": "在河畔，慢下来",
  "A small boat, evening clouds and quiet water between the islands of Si Phan Don.": "小船、晚霞，以及四千美岛之间宁静的水面。",
  "Where your coffee begins": "寻找杯中咖啡的起点",
  "Look closer at coffee cherries and discover Paksong, in the heart of Lao coffee country.": "近看咖啡果，认识老挝咖啡产区腹地的巴松（Paksong）。",
  "Into nature": "走进自然",
  "Green mountains and villages tucked into valleys": "青山与藏在山谷中的村落",
