  "Discover local traditions with care and respect": "怀着尊重与关怀了解当地传统",
  "By the river": "河畔休闲",
  "Find a quiet moment beside the water": "在水边寻找片刻宁静",
  "Outdoor moments": "户外活动",
  "Outdoor adventures": "户外活动",
  "See another side of Laos from sky and water": "从天空与水面发现老挝的另一面",
  "See Laos from the air or along the river": "换个视角看老挝，在空中或水上探索精彩",
  "Sample price in Thai baht per person for planning. Group size and included services must be confirmed in a quote.": "所示为每人泰铢参考价，仅供初步规划。出行人数及包含的服务须在正式报价中确认。",
  "Visit Wat Si Saket, Patuxai and Pha That Luang, with a Mekong riverside and night market stroll in the evening. Adjust the stops to your arrival time and site opening hours.": "游览西萨格寺、凯旋门与塔銮，傍晚沿湄公河漫步、逛夜市。根据抵达时间及景点开放时间调整游览安排。",
  "Explore the Buddhist and Hindu sculptures at Buddha Park before moving on. Allow time for your visit and the agreed transfer back to town or onward to the border.": "继续旅程前，漫步香昆寺佛像公园，欣赏佛教与印度教雕塑。为游览及约定的接送预留时间，返回市区或前往边境的路线须事先商定。",
  "Visit Blue Lagoon, then choose Nam Xay Viewpoint if weather and fitness allow, or enjoy more time to relax.": "游览蓝色泻湖（Blue Lagoon），天气及体力允许时可登南赛观景台（Nam Xay），也可选择多留些时间休息。",
  "Tham Chang is an optional final stop if there is time before your agreed transfer to the drop-off point or station.": "时间充裕时，可将坦江洞（Tham Chang）作为最后一站，并为前往约定送达地点或车站预留交通时间。",
  "Spend the day at Kuang Si Falls, walking beside the pools or taking time to rest. Visit the night market back in town if time allows.": "前往光西瀑布，沿水潭散步，或按自己的节奏休息。返回城内后，时间允许可逛夜市。",
  "After arriving in Nong Khiaw, explore town and the views from the Nam Ou bridge. Pha Tok Cave is an optional stop if time and access allow, before returning to the riverside.": "抵达农乔（Nong Khiaw）后漫步小镇，在南欧江大桥上赏景。时间及通行条件允许时，可加游帕托洞（Pha Tok），再返回河畔休息。",
  "Choose a Pha Daeng hike when weather and fitness allow, bringing water and shoes for the steep trail. Rest by the Nam Ou afterwards, or enjoy a riverside day instead of climbing.": "天气及体力允许时可徒步登帕登（Pha Daeng），请携带饮水并穿适合陡坡的鞋。下山后在南欧江畔休息，也可选择全天在河畔放松。",
  "Walk towards Kaang Cave and the rice fields, continuing to Ban Na only if trail conditions and energy allow. Ask locally about access before setting out, and choose a distance that suits your group.": "从村落步行至康洞（Kaang Cave）及周边稻田，仅在步道状况和体力允许时继续前往班纳村（Ban Na）。出发前向当地了解通行情况，并选择适合同行者的步行距离。",
  "Begin in the Pakse–Champasak area and visit Vat Phou as arrival time allows. Leave time for the paths and stairs through the temple complex.": "从巴色—占巴塞地区开启行程，根据抵达时间游览瓦普寺。请为遗址内的步道和石阶预留时间。",
  "Visit Khone Phapheng Falls before moving on, with the trip end point agreed and enough transfer time for your onward bus or flight.": "继续旅程前游览孔帕平瀑布，事先商定行程终点，并为后续巴士或航班预留充足的接驳时间。",
  "After arriving, explore Vang Vieng as time allows": "抵达后，根据时间安排漫步万荣小镇",
  "Visit Blue Lagoon for scenery and time to relax": "游览蓝色泻湖，赏景休息",
  "Travellers who can adapt their boat travel plans": "能灵活调整乘船安排的游客",
  "Travellers planning a short capital stay": "计划在万象短暂停留的游客",
  "Travellers who want to choose activities to suit them": "希望按自身情况选择活动的游客",
  "Consider Blue Lagoon and, if weather and fitness allow, Nam Xay Viewpoint. Travellers who skip the climb can choose more time to relax.": "游览蓝色泻湖（Blue Lagoon），天气及体力允许时可登南赛观景台（Nam Xay），也可选择多留些时间休息。",
  "Travellers who want both town walks and a waterfall day": "希望兼顾古城漫步与瀑布游览的游客",
  "Travellers balancing a hike with downtime": "希望兼顾徒步与休息的游客",
  "Travellers who enjoy an unhurried stay": "喜爱慢节奏旅行的游客",
  "Travellers who enjoy scenic walks and village visits": "喜欢漫步自然、探访村落的游客",
  "Travellers comfortable with transfers between destinations": "能适应景点之间交通转移的游客",
  "Consider Pha Daeng when weather and fitness allow. Bring water and footwear suited to a steep trail. Keep the rest of the day for Nam Ou scenery and rest; travellers who skip the climb can enjoy a relaxed riverside day.": "天气及体力允许时可徒步登帕登（Pha Daeng），请携带饮水并穿适合陡坡的鞋。下山后在南欧江畔休息，也可选择全天在河畔放松。",
  "Choose a gentle pace or add activities. Nam Xay has a steep climb; river activities depend on conditions and each traveller’s ability.": "可选择轻松游览或增加活动。南赛观景台（Nam Xay）登山路较陡，水上活动则取决于水况及每位游客的身体状况与体能。",
  "Follow the Nam Ou through limestone mountains": "沿南欧江欣赏石灰岩群山",
  "Outdoor activities": "户外活动",
