  "Sekong": "色贡",
  "Lamam": "拉曼（Lamam）",
  "Forest waterfalls and ethnic traditions": "森林瀑布与民族传统",
  "A small, unspoilt province crossed by the Sekong River, with roadside waterfalls and Katu and Talieng villages.": "保有自然风貌的小省份，色贡河穿境而过，沿途有瀑布，以及卡图族和塔良族村落。",
  "Tad Faek": "塔法克瀑布（Tad Faek）",
  "A 5 m waterfall with two swimming pools, close to town.": "距离城镇不远的约5米高瀑布，拥有两处可游泳的水潭。",
  "Tad Hua Khon": "塔华孔瀑布（Tad Hua Khon）",
  "A waterfall about 100 m wide whose name recalls a WWII episode.": "宽约100米的瀑布，其名称源于第二次世界大战期间的一段往事。",
  "Sekong River trip": "色贡河之旅",
  "Long-tail boat trips along the edge of the Bolaven down to Attapeu.": "乘长尾船沿波罗芬高原边缘顺流而下，前往阿速坡。",
  "Xe Xap NPA": "色沙国家保护区（Xe Xap）",
  "Forested plateaus at about 1,400 m, home to large mammals.": "海拔约1400米、森林覆盖的高原，是大型哺乳动物的栖息地。",
  "Kandone Village": "坎东村（Kandone）",
  "Known for woodcarving and traditional longhouses.": "以木雕与传统长屋闻名的村落。",
  "Pakse": "巴色",
  "Southern Laos at its best — World Heritage Vat Phou, the 4,000 Islands, Khone Phapheng falls and the Bolaven Plateau; easy to reach from Ubon Ratchathani via Chong Mek.": "汇集老挝南部精华：世界遗产瓦普寺、四千美岛、孔帕平瀑布和波罗芬高原，可从泰国乌汶经崇墨口岸便利抵达。",
  "An ancient Khmer temple at the foot of a mountain, UNESCO-listed since 2001.": "山脚下的古代高棉寺庙，2001年列入联合国教科文组织世界遗产名录。",
  "Si Phan Don (4,000 Islands)": "四千美岛（Si Phan Don）",
  "The Mekong spreads into countless islands — stay on Don Det, Don Khon or Don Khong.": "湄公河在此舒展开来，形成无数岛屿，可选择在东德岛（Don Det）、东孔岛（Don Khon）或孔岛（Don Khong）住宿。",
  "Mekong cascades often called the largest waterfall in Southeast Asia by volume.": "湄公河上的壮阔瀑布群，常被称为东南亚水量最大的瀑布。",
  "Li Phi Falls": "利皮瀑布（Li Phi）",
  "The Mekong thundering through rocky channels on Don Khon.": "湄公河水在东孔岛（Don Khon）的岩石水道间奔腾而过。",
  "Tad Fane": "塔凡瀑布（Tad Fane）",
  "Twin falls plunging about 120 m on the Bolaven Plateau.": "波罗芬高原上高约120米的双瀑布。",
  "Paksong coffee farms": "巴松咖啡农场（Paksong）",
  "Taste fresh coffee where Laos' best-known beans are grown.": "在老挝知名咖啡豆的产地品尝新鲜咖啡。",
  "Attapeu": "阿速坡",
  "Samakkhixay": "萨马基赛（Samakkhixay）",
  "Nong Fa lake and the falls of Xe Pian": "农法湖与色片森林瀑布",
  "The far southeast: a capital in a scenic valley, a sacred lake, waterfalls in protected forest and a Lane Xang–era stupa.": "位于老挝最东南端，省会坐落于秀丽山谷，拥有神圣湖泊、保护林中的瀑布，以及澜沧王国时期的佛塔。",
  "Nong Fa Lake": "农法湖（Nong Fa）",
  "A mountain lake believed to fill an old volcanic crater, sacred to villagers.": "一座被认为形成于古火山口的高山湖泊，当地居民视其为圣地。",
  "Tad Saepha": "塔塞帕瀑布（Tad Saepha）",
  "A waterfall on the Xe Pian river, reached on foot or by boat with a guide from Ban Mai.": "色片河上的瀑布，可由班迈村出发，在向导带领下徒步或乘船前往。",
  "Saysettha Stupa": "赛塞塔佛塔（Saysettha）",
  "A stupa built in 1577, linked to King Setthathirath of Lane Xang.": "建于1577年的佛塔，与澜沧王国的赛塔提拉国王有关。",
  "Samakkhixay morning market": "萨马基赛早市",
  "An early market where many ethnic groups trade local produce.": "各民族居民在清晨交易当地农产品的市场。",
  "Dong Amphan NPA": "东安潘国家保护区（Dong Amphan）",
  "A vast protected forest that shelters tigers, elephants and rare wildlife.": "广阔的保护林，是老虎、大象及珍稀野生动物的栖息地。",
  "Northern Laos": "老挝北部",
  "Mountains, hill peoples and a World Heritage town": "群山、山地民族与世界遗产古城",
  "High mountains and rivers — from World Heritage Luang Prabang and the Plain of Jars to hill-tribe villages in the far north.": "从世界遗产古城琅勃拉邦与石缸平原，到最北端的山地民族村落，沿途尽是高山与河流。",
  "Central Laos": "老挝中部",
  "A riverside capital, karst peaks and remarkable caves": "河畔首都、喀斯特群峰与奇妙洞穴",
  "From the Mekong-side capital to the limestone peaks of Vang Vieng, Kong Lor cave and colonial Savannakhet — with several easy crossings from Thailand.": "从湄公河畔的首都，到万荣的石灰岩群峰、贡洛洞穴和沙湾拿吉的殖民时期老城，多个口岸方便从泰国入境。",
  "Southern Laos": "老挝南部",
  "Ancient temples, waterfalls and the 4,000 Islands": "古寺、瀑布与四千美岛",
  "World Heritage Vat Phou, the coffee-and-waterfall Bolaven Plateau, and the Mekong spreading into the 4,000 Islands.": "世界遗产瓦普寺、咖啡与瀑布相伴的波罗芬高原，以及湄公河舒展而成的四千美岛。",
